			"Message": "chore(deps): update Queue submodule to latest commit\n\n- Updates the Queue dependency submodule to commit 681541bcdad97f8cd02bacf9699dba8c537fefac\n- Likely includes performance improvements or critical fixes for the IPC/async task management system used in Mountain's dispatcher (Track) and Cocoon's extension host communication\n- Maintains compatibility with evolving RPC patterns in Vine IPC layer while following Land's dependency hygiene practices\n- Specific changes in Queue may relate to:\n  - Enhanced message queue reliability for extension host communications\n  - Memory optimization in async task processing\n  - Improved backpressure handling in high-load scenarios\n- Ensures Land remains aligned with upstream improvements in core infrastructure components",
